{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 91750, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 64356, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "11.11新角评价", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1636463136, "updated_at": 1639266879, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639266879, "last_at": 1660931017, "comment_count": 45, "status": 1, "summary": "几个Q＆A：Q：蒙眼怎么配队？A：Q：蒙眼用什么点火石？A：红防-HP-HP＝红防-红攻-HP＞红攻-红防-HP＞红防-HP-任意词条=红攻-HP-HP＞红防-红攻-任意词条Q：蒙眼出来了是不是木伞就", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636536823454_38233644.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 23294, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 91750, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><b><br></b></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636519210902_97510099.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636519210902_97510099.png\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">几个Q＆A：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：蒙眼怎么配队？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">A：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636536823454_38233644.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636536823454_38233644.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">Q：蒙眼用什么点火石？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">A：<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红防-HP-HP</span></span>＝<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红防-红攻-HP</span>＞<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红攻-红防-HP</span>＞<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红防-HP-任意词条</span>=<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红攻-HP-HP</span>＞<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">红防-红攻-任意词条</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">Q：蒙眼出来了是不是木伞就下岗了？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">A：错，蒙眼的乱舞之刃是PVP限定，打WB你还得靠木伞。并且乱舞之刃是可叠加DOT，在<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">PVP中木伞和蒙眼是最佳搭档</span>，别搞错了。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">Q：蒙眼是谁的上位？在PVP中替换谁？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">A：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">蒙眼不是任何人的上位，却又是所有人的上位。</span>不知道你能不能理解，之前的干扰只能提供控制或者输出其中一种，刀也是只能提供输出，而蒙眼又有输出又有控制，是干扰和刀特点集于一身的角色。毫不夸张的说，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">你用蒙眼替换掉目前队伍中任何一位干扰角色或者刀角色，都是合理的配队。</span></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">Q：<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">蒙眼出来了是不是鲜花就下岗了？</span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">A：错，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">虽然说蒙眼对于鲜花妹的克制效果很明显，但鲜花妹仍然是目前PVP第一辅助，你不带她，你还能带谁呢？</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">蒙眼和鲜花妹的搭配一样很强势，可以加快控制频率以及炸Buff频率。</span><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Q：关于光自请妃？</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：和火伞一样属于新年Child，将会在2022年春节实装，初步估测是以WB的方式实装，短期内不会空降，各位可以放心。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\"></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636536823454_38233644.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_n